:: Chapter One {"position":"1000,500","size":"100,100"}
(set: $canusemenu to true)bee-beep- BEEP! BEEP!

The alarm clock snaps you out of the cozy dream you had from the night before.
(text-style:"bold","italic","blurrier","buoy", "fidget")[ [[Sleep Sleep Sleep Sleep Sleep->Sleep Ending One]] ]
{You rub your sleepy eyes and look at the (link-rerun: "clock")[(dialog: [6:00:AM], "Dimiss.")].
}
You should probably [[wake up.->wake up]]
(track: 'clock', 'play')


