:: MotherBossFight {"position":"1375,800","size":"100,100"}
The thing looks at you as you approach... it's obviously suffering... 

(link-replace: "Get Closer")[IT LUNGES OUT OF THE BED AND ATTACKS ITS CLAWS LEAVE DEEP SCRATCHES!!!
IT SHRIEKS IN PAIN WITH EACH MOVEMENT!!!
DO SOMETHING NOW


]


:: MotherReveal {"position":"1125,800","size":"100,100"}
(link-replace: "You grip the handle and twist...")[(link-replace: "THE")[(link-replace: "DOOR")[(link-replace: "CREAKS OPEN...")[(force-input:  bind _confirm, "Turn on the light")
(link-rerun: "Confirm")[(if: _confirm is "Turn on the light")[

[[You step in. . .->MothersRoom]] ] ] ] ] ] ]


:: MothersRoom {"position":"1250,800","size":"100,100"}
(set: $loading to false)(dialog: [THAT IS THING IS NOT YOUR MOTHER], "WHAT THE FUCK ARE YOU!"){

}On the bed lays the one thing that used to hurt you the most and now its something twisted, beyond recongnition, and utterly breaking in many ways.

[[Approach the bed.->MotherBossFight]]

{(if: $playerpanic is false)[ [[Try the door behind you->Playermotherbrokedoor]] ]
(else:)[The door is of no use something from the monsters presences seems to stop you from being about to open the door]}
(track: 'motherbossfight', 'play')


