:: PlayerBasement {"position":"1300,950","size":"100,100"}
{(if: $pbk is false)[(link-rerun: "Try the basement door")[(dialog: [The door is locked you need the key], "Walk back and keep searching.")] ]
}(else-if: $pbk is true)[(link-rerun:  "Try the basement door")[(dialog: [You have unlocked the door [[Enter the basement.->PlayerBasementUnlocked]] ], "Maybe later. . .")] ]

[[PlayerHHF1<-walk back.]]


:: PlayerBasementUnlocked {"position":"1300,1050","size":"100,100"}
{The first thing that catches your eyes in the basement is the (link-rerun: "medkit cabnit")[
	(if: $pbmedkit is false)[(dialog: [The cabnit is empty.], "Close the cabnit")]
	(else-if: $pbmedkit is true)[
    	(set: $medkit to it + 1)
    	(dialog: [You got a medkit!], "Take the medkit")[(set: $pbmedkit to false)(notify: '3s')[Medkit added to Inventory] ] ] ]}

{(if: $housekey is false)[(link-replace: "Something on the floor catches your eye.")[(link-replace: "Theres a key on the ground.")[(link-replace: "Take the key.")[There is nothing on the ground anymore.(set: $housekey to true)] ] ] ]
(else:)[There is nothing on the ground anymore.]}

[[Head back.->PlayerHHF1]]


:: PlayerDiningRoom {"position":"1300,1200","size":"100,100"}
You enter the (link-rerun: "dining room")[(dialog: [It reeks of decay, putrifaction, and rot.], "Its disgusting")] it doesnt seem right.
Flies buzz around the (link-rerun: "rotten meat.")[(dialog: [The meat resemble meat of what looks to be a human], "DON'T PUKE!")]

(link-rerun: "Examine Table")[
(if: $hasknife is false)[(link-replace: " Take knife?")[There is no knife on the table.(set: $hasknife to true)(dialog: [You have a knife.], "Nice.")] ]{
}(else-if: $hasknife is true)[There is no knife on the table.]]

[[Exit the dining room->PlayerHHF1]]


:: PlayerFrontDoor {"position":"1100,1200","size":"100,100"}
{(if: $housekey is true)[(link-replace: "Unlock the door")[The door unlocks [[Step Out->Chapter One Front Door Ending]] ] ]
(else-if: $housekey is false)[The door is locked.]}

[[Walk Back->PlayerHHF1]]


:: PlayerHHBathroom {"position":"875,800","size":"100,100"}
The bathroom tile are cold against your feet.
{(link-rerun: "you glance in the mirror")[(dialog: [You look in the mirror you look...
disgusting... You look filfthy... maybe you are a monster... or maybe you are just depressed], "Failure.")]}
(if: $takeshower is false)[You should probably [[take a shower]]. ]{
(else-if: $takeshower is true)[]}
[[Leave the bathroom.->PlayerHouseHall]]


:: PlayerHHF1 {"position":"1100,1000","size":"100,100"}
You walk down the [[stairs->PlayerHouseHall]], they (link-rerun: "creak")[(dialog: [The stairs are old hardwood floor.], "Continue.")] as you step down them.
The hallway of the first floor lays ahead of you.
Behind you and further down the stairs is the [[PlayerBasement<-basement]].
On your right is the [[PlayerKitchen<-kitchen]].
Your left portrays the enterance to the [[PlayerDiningRoom<-dining room]]
At the far end of the hall you the the [[exit->PlayerFrontDoor]]


:: PlayerHHOffice {"position":"875,900","size":"100,100"}
{

(set: _officepistolnotif to 0)
(if: $hasgun is true and _officepistolnotif is 0)[(notify: '3s')[Handgun added to inventory] ]

}The office is dark it has a computer with decent specs on it
(link-rerun: "The room")[(dialog:[The air in this room is dry, the walls are covered with sound proofing material and not much else is of notice.], "Dismiss")] is small.

The desk the contains the computers monitor
Aswell as a safe on it with a [[PlayerOfficeKeypad<-key pad.]]

[[Walk back to the hallway.->PlayerHouseHall]]


:: PlayerHouseHall {"position":"1000,800","size":"100,100"}
{(set: _torture to (a: "Not again!", "I don't wan't to see that again!", "Please no!", "Don't make me do it!", "I won't enter again!", "It hurts to see that room!"))
}You walk into the hall and (link-rerun: "the AC air")[(dialog: [A cold blast of air hits your body from a nearby vent.], "Feels nice.")] hits you almost instantly.

The dark hallway of the second floor lies ahead of you to the right are the [[stairs->PlayerHHF1]].

The first door to the left leads to the [[bathroom->PlayerHHBathroom]]
Next door further up but still to the left would enter the [[office->PlayerHHOffice]]
All the way at the very end of the hall is the {(if: $mru is false)[
	(link-rerun: "Your mothers room.")[
    	(set: $hjc to it + 1)(if: $hjc is 6)[
        	(track: 'jumpscare', 'play')]
           (set: _hurtmessage to _torture's random)(dialog: [_hurtmessage], "Don't remind yourself.")] ]
(else-if: $mru is true)[
(link-rerun: "Your mothers room")[(dialog: [Are you sure you want to enter your [[Mothers Room?->MotherReveal]]], "Maybe later.")] ]}


:: PlayerKitchen {"position":"900,1100","size":"100,100"}
The kitchen is empty save for what you would usually find in a kitchen...
(if: $pbk is true)[There is nothing on the table.]{
}(else-if: $pbk is false)[Except for the (link-append: "keys")[(set: $pbk to true)(dialog: [You grab the keys off the table], "Take the basement keys.")[(go-to: "PlayerKitchen")] ] that are on the table]

[[go back->PlayerHHF1]]
<!--Pbk is the player house basement key-->


:: PlayerOfficeKeypad {"position":"750,900","size":"100,100"}
{(if: $hasgun is true)[ [[The safe is empty->PlayerHHOffice]] ]
}(else-if: $hasgun is false)[There is a (link-rerun: "poem here")[(dialog: [Sally sailed the Seven Seas, her Five sibling came with the, Two were lost, One was found... now change these numbers someway around.], "Put the poem back.")], under the poem is (link-rerun: "a letter")[(dialog:[The two souls.
The lone survivor.
The several seas.
The chosen's followers.], "Put down the note.")]

You can always [[Leave the room.->PlayerHHOffice]] ]

{(if: $hasgun is false)[(link-rerun: "Try code?")[
	(set: $safecode to (prompt: "Enter Code", ""))
    	(if: $safecode is "2175")[
        	(set: $hasgun to true) (set: $GunBullets's "Handgun Bullets" to it + $Pammoadd) (set: $Guns's "Handgun" to true)
            	(dialog: [In the safe was a .45 ACP hangun.], "Take the handgun.")[
                	(dialog: [Next to the gun is a case of 45 ACP ammunition.], "Check the case")[
                    	(dialog: [In the case of bullets was $Pammoadd (if: $Pammoadd > 1 )[bullets.](else:)[bullet.] ], "Take the ammo.")[
                        	(go-to: "PlayerOfficeKeypad")] ] ] ]
        (else:)[(dialog: [Thats not the code], "Dismiss.")] ] ]}


