:: take a shower {"position":"750,800","size":"100,100"}
Enjoy the shower, the water cascades of you skin warm, the steam rising from the water.
You miss when things where more relaxed, when you were a kid.
That's long gone.

Well... whenever you are ready you can [[step out.->PlayerHHBathroom]]
(set: $takeshower to true)


:: wake up {"position":"1000,650","size":"100,100"}
{(set: _prescriptions to (a: "Risperidone 10 mg.", "Paliperidone 5 mg.", "Duloxetine 60 mg.", "Lamotrogine 200 mg.", "Propranolol 30 mg.", "Adderall-XR 30 mg.") )
}You sit up and look around.

It's... (text-style:"bold","smear","rumble")[dark], the dim lamp in the corner barely illuminates the room.

Your room consist of a few things, a desk with a desktop left open on
(link-rerun: "godot")[(dialog:[The name of the project seems to be called Faithfully Faltured], "Dismiss.")], from last nights projects.

{A couple of (link-rerun: "pill bottles")[(set: _changemed to _prescriptions's random)(dialog: [This bottle says _changemed], "Put down the bottle.")] are on the desk.}

its probably best if you [[start your day->PlayerHouseHall]]


